#: base/bugs.html:16
msgid "Reporting bugs"
msgstr "Prijavljivanje grešaka"

#: base/bugs.html:19
#, python-format
msgid ""
"calibre is a very rapidly evolving piece of software, with weekly releases. As a results bugs are inevitable.\n"
"We rely on calibre's users to report these bugs, so that they can be fixed as quickly as possible. To report\n"
"bugs use the <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"%(href)s\">calibre bug tracker</a>.\n"
"Note that you will have to register for a free account first."
msgstr ""
"calibre je softver koji se veoma brzo razvija, sa nedeljnim izdanjima. Kao rezultat toga, greške su neizbežne.\n"
"Oslanjamo se na korisnike calibre-a da prijave ove greške, kako bi mogle biti ispravljene što je brže moguće. Za prijavljivanje\n"
"grešaka koristite <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"%(href)s\">calibre sistem za praćenje grešaka</a>.\n"
"Imajte na umu da ćete prvo morati da registrujete besplatan nalog."

#: base/bugs.html:24
msgid ""
"When reporting bugs please include <b>as much information as possible</b>, as that makes it easier for us to identify\n"
"the source of the problem. Remember that calibre is developed by volunteers in their spare time, so by taking these steps, you\n"
"are helping to ensure that as much of that time as possible is spent actually coding as opposed to doing administrative tasks\n"
"like closing duplicate bug reports."
msgstr ""
"Kada prijavljujete greške, molimo vas da uključite <b>što je više moguće informacija</b>, jer nam to olakšava da identifikujemo\n"
"izvor problema. Zapamtite da calibre razvijaju volonteri u svoje slobodno vreme, tako da preduzimanjem ovih koraka,\n"
"pomažete da se osigura da se što više tog vremena provede u samom programiranju, a ne u obavljanju administrativnih zadataka\n"
"kao što je zatvaranje dupliranih izveštaja o greškama."

#: base/bugs.html:29
msgid ""
"If you are including some <strong>sensitive data</strong> in your bug report\n"
"like a copyrighted book or a debug log, mark the bug as \"private\", then the\n"
"data will not be visible to all. You can do this by finding the location where\n"
"it says \"This report contains <b>Public</b> information\" in the top right area\n"
"of the bug's page and clicking the yellow icon next to it."
msgstr ""
"Ako uključujete neke <strong>osetljive podatke</strong> u vaš izveštaj o grešci\n"
"kao što je knjiga zaštićena autorskim pravima ili dnevnik za otklanjanje grešaka, označite grešku kao \"privatnu\", tada\n"
"podaci neće biti vidljivi svima. To možete uraditi tako što ćete pronaći mesto gde\n"
"piše \"This report contains <b>Public</b> information\" u gornjem desnom uglu\n"
"stranice sa greškom i kliknuti na žutu ikonu pored toga."

#: base/bugs.html:35
msgid ""
"You can also use the bug tracker to <b>request new features</b>. To mark a bug report as a request for a new feature just add [Enhancement] to the subject.\n"
"Please remember that calibre is a highly complex piece of software with millions of users, as such, the priorities of \n"
"calibre's developers may not match your own and your feature request may well be ignored. Since calibre is open source, one sure way to get your\n"
"feature request more attention is to implement it yourself and attach the patch implementing it to the bug report."
msgstr ""
"Takođe možete koristiti sistem za praćenje grešaka da <b>zatražite nove funkcije</b>. Da biste označili izveštaj o grešci kao zahtev za novu funkciju, samo dodajte [Enhancement] u naslov.\n"
"Molimo vas da zapamtite da je calibre veoma složen softver sa milionima korisnika, pa se prioriteti \n"
"programera calibre-a možda neće poklapati sa vašim i vaš zahtev za funkcijom može biti ignorisan. Pošto je calibre otvorenog koda, jedan siguran način da vaš\n"
"zahtev za funkcijom dobije više pažnje je da ga sami implementirate i priložite zakrpu koja ga implementira uz izveštaj o grešci."

#: base/help.html:17
msgid "New to calibre?"
msgstr "Novi ste u calibre-u?"

#: base/help.html:19
msgid ""
"calibre is intuitive, but also very powerful. To quickly start using it,\n"
"get the most out of it or get assistance and tips, you can check out: "
msgstr ""
