msgstr ""
"Ako želite redovno da doprinosite calibre-u, možete postati calibre\n"
"patron, koristeći <a href=\"%(pat)s\">Patreon servis</a>, <a href=\"%(gh)s\">GitHub Sponsors servis</a> ili <a href=\"%(librepay)s\">Liberapay servis</a>."

#: base/get-involved.html:16
msgid "Getting involved with calibre"
msgstr "Uključivanje u calibre"

#: base/get-involved.html:19
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The secret of calibre's success is its vibrant user community. Users have contributed code and become developers,\n"
"translations to make calibre available in different languages, graphics to improve its look and feel and of course\n"
"thousands of bug reports to help make it the robust piece of software it is today. An incomplete list of\n"
"contributors to calibre is available <a href=\"%(href)s\">here</a>."
msgstr ""
"Tajna uspeha calibre-a je njegova živa zajednica korisnika. Korisnici su doprineli kodom i postali programeri,\n"
"prevodima kako bi calibre bio dostupan na različitim jezicima, grafikom za poboljšanje izgleda i osećaja i naravno\n"
"hiljadama prijava grešaka kako bi pomogli da postane robustan softver kakav je danas. Nepotpun spisak\n"
"saradnika na calibre-u je dostupan <a href=\"%(href)s\">ovde</a>."

#: base/get-involved.html:25
msgid "Joining the calibre community"
msgstr "Pridruživanje calibre zajednici"

#: base/get-involved.html:27
msgid ""
"To talk with fellow calibre users and keep abreast of the latest "
"developments in calibre-world, you can use several tools:"
msgstr ""
"Da biste razgovarali sa drugim korisnicima calibre-a i bili u toku sa "
"najnovijim dešavanjima u calibre svetu, možete koristiti nekoliko alata:"

#: base/get-involved.html:29
#, python-format
msgid "The calibre <a href=\"%(href)s\">user forum</a>"
msgstr "calibre <a href=\"%(href)s\">korisnički forum</a>"

#: base/get-involved.html:30
#, python-format
msgid "The <a href=\"%(href)s\">calibre Facebook page</a>"
msgstr "<a href=\"%(href)s\">calibre Facebook stranica</a>"

#: base/get-involved.html:31
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The calibre new releases <a href=\"%(href)s\" "
"type=\"application/rss+xml\">RSS</a> feed"
msgstr ""
"<a href=\"%(href)s\" type=\"application/rss+xml\">RSS</a> dovod za nova "
"izdanja calibre-a"

#: base/get-involved.html:34
msgid "Creating a calibre plugin"
msgstr "Pravljenje calibre priključka"

#: base/get-involved.html:35
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"calibre has a comprehensive plugin interface, that allows the creation of plugins that can do just about anything. For many examples, see the\n"
"<a href=\"%(plugins)s\">calibre Plugins forum</a>. A tutorial on getting started with plugin development,\n"
"<a href=\"%(pdocs)s\">is available</a>."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"calibre ima sveobuhvatan interfejs za priključke, koji omogućava pravljenje priključaka koji mogu da urade skoro sve. Za mnoge primere, pogledajte\n"
"<a href=\"%(plugins)s\">calibre forum za priključke</a>. Uputstvo za početak razvoja priključaka,\n"
"<a href=\"%(pdocs)s\">je dostupno</a>."

#: base/get-involved.html:40
msgid "Contributing translations to calibre"
msgstr "Doprinos prevodima za calibre"

#: base/get-involved.html:41
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"calibre has support for translating its user interface. You can see the list of languages for which translations exist\n"
"<a target=\"new\" href=\"%(tmain)s\">here</a>. If the translations for your language\n"
"are incomplete/missing, you can contribute the translations using a simple web-based interface.\n"
"To do so first create an account in <a target=\"new\" href=\"%(signup)s\">Transifex</a>,\n"
"then click on your language in <a target=\"new\" href=\"%(project)s\">this page</a>.\n"
"Click on the <i>\"Join Team\"</i> button. Once you have been approved, simply click on the language you want to translate\n"
"<a href=\"%(tmain)s\">here</a> and use the <i>\"Translate Now\"</i> button\n"
"to contribute your translations."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"calibre ima podršku za prevođenje svog korisničkog interfejsa. Možete videti listu jezika za koje postoje prevodi\n"
"<a target=\"new\" href=\"%(tmain)s\">ovde</a>. Ako su prevodi za vaš jezik\n"
"nepotpuni/nedostaju, možete doprineti prevodima koristeći jednostavan veb interfejs.\n"
"Da biste to uradili, prvo napravite nalog na <a target=\"new\" href=\"%(signup)s\">Transifex-u</a>,\n"
"zatim kliknite na vaš jezik na <a target=\"new\" href=\"%(project)s\">ovoj stranici</a>.\n"
"Kliknite na dugme <i>\"Join Team\"</i>. Kada budete odobreni, jednostavno kliknite na jezik koji želite da prevodite\n"
"<a href=\"%(tmain)s\">ovde</a> i koristite dugme <i>\"Translate Now\"</i>\n"
"da biste doprineli vašim prevodima."

#: base/get-involved.html:51
msgid ""
"Alternatively you can download the PO file to do your translations offline\n"
"by using the <i>\"Download for translation\"</i> link instead of the <i>\"Translate\n"
"Now\"</i> button. You can edit the PO file using your favorite translation software\n"
"and when you are done, upload the file by clicking the <i>\"Upload file\"</i>\n"
"link (which is just below the <i>\"Download for translation\"</i> link)."
msgstr ""
"Alternativno, možete preuzeti PO fajl da biste radili prevode oflajn\n"
"koristeći link <i>\"Download for translation\"</i> umesto dugmeta <i>\"Translate\n"
"Now\"</i>. Možete uređivati PO fajl koristeći vaš omiljeni softver za prevođenje\n"
"i kada završite, otpremite fajl klikom na link <i>\"Upload file\"</i>\n"
"(koji se nalazi odmah ispod linka <i>\"Download for translation\"</i>)."

#: base/get-involved.html:57
msgid "Translations FAQ"
msgstr "Često postavljana pitanja o prevodima"

#: base/get-involved.html:59
msgid ""
"What to do with the &amp; symbols?<br />The &amp; symbols denote a keyboard shortcut.\n"
"    So for example the string \"&amp;Title\" means that the corresponding GUI element can be accessed\n"
"    with the keyboard shortcut \"Alt+T\" (this only works on Windows/Linux).\n"
"    So in your translation leave the &amp; symbol before the same letter if possible, or some other suitable letter."
msgstr ""
"Šta raditi sa &amp; simbolima?<br />Simboli &amp; označavaju prečicu na tastaturi.\n"
"    Tako na primer string \"&amp;Title\" znači da se odgovarajućem elementu GUI-ja može pristupiti\n"
"    prečicom na tastaturi \"Alt+T\" (ovo radi samo na Windows/Linux sistemima).\n"
"    Zato u vašem prevodu ostavite &amp; simbol ispred istog slova ako je moguće, ili nekog drugog odgovarajućeg slova."

#: base/get-involved.html:64
#, python-format
msgid ""
"What to do with the \"%%A_Word\" characters?<br />The %% character and a word to the right of it\n"
"    (no space between the percentage sign and the word), denotes a word that will be replaced by the code.\n"
"    So when encountering this symbol and a word right next to it (example: %%default), don't change it.\n"
"    Keep it as is in the translated sentence. Similarly for sequences like %%s or %%d, leave them as is. Finally, sequences\n"
"    like %%(some_word)s should also be left unchanged."
msgstr ""
"Šta raditi sa \"%%A_Word\" karakterima?<br />Karakter %% i reč desno od njega\n"
"    (bez razmaka između znaka procenta i reči), označava reč koja će biti zamenjena kodom.\n"
"    Zato kada naiđete na ovaj simbol i reč odmah pored njega (primer: %%default), nemojte ga menjati.\n"
"    Zadržite ga takvog kakav jeste u prevedenoj rečenici. Slično tome, za sekvence kao što su %%s ili %%d, ostavite ih kakve jesu. Konačno, sekvence\n"
"    kao što je %%(some_word)s takođe treba ostaviti nepromenjene."

#: base/get-involved.html:70
msgid ""
"What to do with <code>{word}</code> constructs?<br />These are placeholders and must not be translated. They\n"
"        will be replaced with actual content by the code."
msgstr ""
"Šta raditi sa <code>{word}</code> konstrukcijama?<br />Ovo su rezervirana mesta i ne smeju se prevoditi. Oni\n"
"        će biti zamenjeni stvarnim sadržajem od strane koda."

#: base/get-involved.html:73
msgid ""
"What to do with date strings like dd MMM yyy?<br />These must be left "
"untranslated."
msgstr ""
"Šta raditi sa stringovima datuma kao što je dd MMM yyy?<br />Ovi moraju "
"ostati neprevedeni."

#: base/get-involved.html:75
#, python-format
msgid ""
"What to do with the special markup when translating the User Manual?<br />\n"
"        The User Manual is written in <a href=\"%(sphinx)s\">reStructuredText</a>. \n"
"        You will see many constructs like <code>:guilabel:`Some text`</code>. Here the\n"
"        <code>:guilabel:``</code> part is markup, like HTML tags. You should only\n"
"        translate the text within the backticks. Particular care must be taken with links, of the following forms:"
msgstr ""
"Šta raditi sa specijalnim označavanjem prilikom prevođenja Korisničkog uputstva?<br />\n"
"        Korisničko uputstvo je napisano u <a href=\"%(sphinx)s\">reStructuredText-u</a>. \n"
"        Videćete mnoge konstrukcije kao što je <code>:guilabel:`Neki tekst`</code>. Ovde je\n"
"        <code>:guilabel:``</code> deo označavanja, kao HTML tagovi. Trebalo bi samo da\n"
"        prevedete tekst unutar obrnutih apostrofa. Posebnu pažnju treba obratiti na linkove, u sledećim oblicima:"

#: base/get-involved.html:81
msgid "<code>:ref:`some text`</code> Here nothing must be translated."
msgstr "<code>:ref:`some text`</code> Ovde se ništa ne sme prevoditi."

#: base/get-involved.html:82
msgid ""
"<code>:ref:`Some text &lt;link-location&gt;`</code> Here only \"Some text\" "
"must be translated."
msgstr ""
"<code>:ref:`Neki tekst &lt;link-location&gt;`</code> Ovde se mora prevesti "
"samo \"Neki tekst\"."

#: base/get-involved.html:83
msgid ""
"<code>``Some text``</code> This is a literal and nothing should be "
"translated in it."
msgstr ""
"<code>``Some text``</code> Ovo je doslovni tekst i u njemu se ništa ne "
"prevodi."

#: base/get-involved.html:84
msgid ""
"<code>:doc:`generated/en/something`</code> Should be replaced by "
":doc:`generated/your_language_code/something`. For example "
"<code>:doc:`generated/en/cli-index`</code> becomes "
"<code>:doc:`generated/de/cli-index`</code> in German."
msgstr ""
"<code>:doc:`generated/en/something`</code> Treba zameniti sa "
":doc:`generated/your_language_code/something`. Na primer "
"<code>:doc:`generated/en/cli-index`</code> postaje "
"<code>:doc:`generated/de/cli-index`</code> na nemačkom."

#: base/get-involved.html:86
#, python-format
msgid ""
"How do I test my translations?<br />First you need to download a .po file for your language from\n"
"        <a href=\"%(tloc)s\" target=\"new\">here</a>.\n"
"    You can test your .po file by setting the environment variable CALIBRE_TEST_TRANSLATION to the path of the downloaded .po file.\n"
"    Then run calibre as normal. Currently, it is not possible to test the User Manual translations."
msgstr ""
"Kako da testiram svoje prevode?<br />Prvo morate preuzeti .po datoteku za vaš jezik sa\n"
"        <a href=\"%(tloc)s\" target=\"new\">ovog mesta</a>.\n"
"    Možete testirati vašu .po datoteku postavljanjem promenljive okruženja CALIBRE_TEST_TRANSLATION na putanju preuzete .po datoteke.\n"
"    Zatim pokrenite calibre normalno. Trenutno nije moguće testirati prevode Korisničkog uputstva."

#: base/get-involved.html:92
