msgid ""
"If you come up with a cool idea and a patch\n"
"for implementing it, let us know about it and more than likely it will be in the next weekly calibre release. A great place to ask for tips\n"
"on calibre hacking is the <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"%(forum)s\">calibre Development forum</a>\n"
"where lots of calibre developers hang out."
msgstr ""
"Ako smislite sjajnu ideju i zakrpu\n"
"za njenu implementaciju, obavestite nas o tome i vrlo verovatno će se naći u sledećem nedeljnom izdanju calibre-a. Odlično mesto za traženje saveta\n"
"o hakovanju calibre-a je <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"%(forum)s\">calibre razvojni forum</a>\n"
"gde se okuplja mnogo calibre programera."

#: base/index.html:116
