msgstr "Uključite se"

#: base/privacy.html:8
msgid ""
"Both calibre and this website collect no information about users or "
"visitors. The only exceptions to this rule are described below."
msgstr ""
"I calibre i ovaj veb-sajt ne prikupljaju nikakve informacije o korisnicima "
"ili posetiocima. Jedini izuzeci od ovog pravila su opisani u nastavku."

#: base/privacy.html:10
msgid "Server logs"
msgstr "Dnevnici servera"

#: base/privacy.html:11
msgid ""
"This website does not log IP addresses or any other personally identifying information. It does collect aggregate usage details\n"
"that are used to breakdown calibre usage by country and platform only. No individual information is stored."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj veb-sajt ne beleži IP adrese niti bilo koje druge lične podatke. Prikuplja samo zbirne podatke o korišćenju\n"
"koji se koriste isključivo za analizu korišćenja calibre-a po zemljama i platformama. Ne čuvaju se pojedinačni podaci."

#: base/privacy.html:14
msgid "Cookies"
msgstr "Kolačići"

#: base/privacy.html:15
msgid ""
"This website does not use cookies, except for the ads and analytics services"
" mentioned below."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj veb-sajt ne koristi kolačiće, osim za usluge oglašavanja i analitike "
"navedene u nastavku."

#: base/privacy.html:17
msgid "Third party advertisements"
msgstr "Oglasi trećih strana"

#: base/privacy.html:18
msgid ""
"This website displays third party advertisements, from the <a href=\"https://freestar.com\">Freestar</a> ads service.\n"
"calibre, the software, displays no ads and uses no third party services for ads."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj veb-sajt prikazuje oglase trećih strana, sa oglasne mreže <a href=\"https://freestar.com\">Freestar</a>.\n"
"calibre, kao softver, ne prikazuje oglase i ne koristi usluge trećih strana za oglase."

#: base/privacy.html:21
msgid "Third party statistics"
msgstr "Statistika trećih strana"

#: base/privacy.html:22
msgid ""
"Additionally, this website uses Google Analytics to analyse website traffic, which is needed for provision of ads, above.\n"
"calibre, the software, uses no statistics service."
msgstr ""
"Pored toga, ovaj veb-sajt koristi Google Analytics za analizu saobraćaja na sajtu, što je potrebno za prikazivanje oglasa, kao što je gore navedeno.\n"
"calibre, kao softver, ne koristi nikakve statističke usluge."

#: base/privacy.html:25
msgid "Changes to this Privacy Statement"
msgstr "Izmene ove Izjave o privatnosti"

#: base/privacy.html:26
msgid ""
"This privacy statement will not change in any substantial way, except for\n"
"possibly changing the services used for ads and statistics on the website, as described above."
msgstr ""
"Ova izjava o privatnosti se neće suštinski menjati, osim\n"
"eventualne promene usluga koje se koriste za oglase i statistiku na veb-sajtu, kao što je gore opisano."

#: base/privacy.html:28
msgid "Last updated: 04 March 2025"
msgstr "Poslednje ažuriranje: 04. mart 2025."

#: base/about.html:3
msgid "About"
msgstr "O programu"

#: base/about.html:81
msgid "About calibre"
msgstr "O calibre-u"

#: base/about.html:83
msgid "A brief description of calibre's many features"
msgstr "Kratak opis mnogih funkcija calibre-a"

#: base/about.html:83
msgid "Features"
msgstr "Funkcije"

#: base/about.html:84
msgid "A history of the development of calibre"
msgstr "Istorija razvoja calibre-a"

#: base/about.html:84
msgid "History"
msgstr "Istorija"

#: base/about.html:85
msgid "The best ways to contact the calibre team"
msgstr "Najbolji načini da kontaktirate calibre tim"

#: base/about.html:85
msgid "Contact"
msgstr "Kontakt"

#: base/about.html:86
msgid "A list of contributors to the calibre community"
msgstr "Spisak saradnika u calibre zajednici"

#: base/about.html:86
msgid "Contributors"
msgstr "Saradnici"

#: base/about.html:87
msgid "Mentions of calibre in the press"
msgstr "Pominjanja calibre-a u štampi"

#: base/about.html:87
msgid "Press"
msgstr "Štampa"

#: base/about.html:94
msgid ""
"<b>calibre is a powerful and easy to use e-book manager</b>. Users say it’s\n"
"        <i>outstanding</i> and a <i>must-have</i>. It’ll allow you to do nearly everything and it\n"
"        takes things a step beyond normal e-book software. It’s also <b>completely free</b>\n"
"        and <i>open source</i> and great for both <b>casual users</b> and computer experts."
msgstr ""
"<b>calibre je moćan i jednostavan menadžer e-knjiga</b>. Korisnici kažu da je\n"
"        <i>izvanredan</i> i <i>neophodan</i>. Omogućiće vam da uradite skoro sve i\n"
"        ide korak dalje od običnog softvera za e-knjige. Takođe je <b>potpuno besplatan</b>\n"
"        i <i>otvorenog koda</i> i odličan je kako za <b>obične korisnike</b> tako i za kompjuterske stručnjake."

#: base/about.html:101
msgid "Save time on managing your e-book collection"
msgstr "Uštedite vreme na upravljanju vašom kolekcijom e-knjiga"

#: base/about.html:104
msgid ""
"calibre’s user interface is designed to be as simple as\n"
"                    possible. <b>Large buttons</b> in the main window take care of\n"
"                    most of your needs. The vast number of calibre’s features\n"
"                    and options is always clearly displayed under <b>intuitive\n"
"                    tabs</b>. Its context menus are neatly sorted, so the things\n"
"                    you’re looking for almost find themselves on their own.\n"
"                    <b>You’re never more than three clicks away from your goal.</b>\n"
"                    It’s the result of years of tweaking calibre’s interface\n"
"                    based on users’ feedback. Plus, you can change many aspects\n"
"                    of how calibre looks and feels, and try one of the three\n"
"                    built-in library views to browse your book collection using\n"
"                    covers, titles, tags, authors, publishers, etc."
msgstr ""
"Korisnički interfejs programa calibre je dizajniran da bude što jednostavniji.\n"
"                    <b>Velika dugmad</b> u glavnom prozoru brinu o\n"
"                    većini vaših potreba. Ogroman broj funkcija i opcija programa calibre\n"
"                    je uvek jasno prikazan pod <b>intuitivnim\n"
"                    karticama</b>. Njegovi kontekstni meniji su uredno sortirani, tako da stvari\n"
"                    koje tražite skoro da se same pronalaze.\n"
"                    <b>Nikada niste udaljeni više od tri klika od svog cilja.</b>\n"
"                    To je rezultat godina podešavanja interfejsa programa calibre\n"
"                    na osnovu povratnih informacija korisnika. Pored toga, možete promeniti mnoge aspekte\n"
"                    izgleda i osećaja programa calibre, i isprobati jedan od tri\n"
"                    ugrađena prikaza biblioteke za pregledanje vaše kolekcije knjiga koristeći\n"
"                    korice, naslove, oznake, autore, izdavače, itd."

#: base/about.html:117
msgid ""
"calibre not only can <b>download all the metadata</b>\n"
"                    for an e-book (things like title, author, publisher, ISBN,\n"
"                    tags, cover or summary) but will also allow you to edit or\n"
"                    create metadata in existing or new fields. That way you can\n"
"                    track which books you’ve read and which ones you liked. You\n"
"                    can also take advantage of the <b>advanced search and\n"
"                    sorting</b> functions that use tags, authors, comments and\n"
"                    more. You will find the book you were looking for in seconds!"
msgstr ""
"calibre ne samo da može <b>preuzeti sve metapodatke</b>\n"
"                    za e-knjigu (stvari kao što su naslov, autor, izdavač, ISBN,\n"
"                    oznake, korice ili sažetak) već će vam takođe omogućiti da uređujete ili\n"
"                    kreirate metapodatke u postojećim ili novim poljima. Na taj način možete\n"
"                    pratiti koje ste knjige pročitali i koje su vam se svidele. Možete\n"
"                    takođe iskoristiti funkcije <b>napredne pretrage i\n"
"                    sortiranja</b> koje koriste oznake, autore, komentare i\n"
"                    više. Pronaći ćete knjigu koju ste tražili za nekoliko sekundi!"

#: base/about.html:130
msgid "Use it everywhere and with anything"
msgstr "Koristite ga svuda i sa bilo čim"

#: base/about.html:133
msgid ""
"calibre supports almost <b>every single e-reader</b> and\n"
"                    is compatible with more devices with every update. You can\n"
"                    transfer your e-books from one device to another in\n"
"                    seconds, <b>wirelessly</b> or with a cable. And you don’t\n"
"                    need any additional tools to do that. calibre will send the\n"
"                    <b>best file format</b> for your device converting it if\n"
"                    needed, automatically. "
msgstr ""
"calibre podržava skoro <b>svaki pojedinačni e-čitač</b> i\n"
"                    kompatibilan je sa više uređaja sa svakim ažuriranjem. Možete\n"
"                    preneti vaše e-knjige sa jednog uređaja na drugi za\n"
"                    nekoliko sekundi, <b>bežično</b> ili pomoću kabla. I ne\n"
"                    trebaju vam nikakvi dodatni alati za to. calibre će poslati\n"
"                    <b>najbolji format datoteke</b> za vaš uređaj konvertujući ga ako\n"
"                    je potrebno, automatski. "

#: base/about.html:141
msgid ""
"No matter what PC, laptop or tablet you use, calibre’s\n"
"                    got you covered. If you’re traveling and don’t have\n"
"                    your device with you – you can take calibre on a USB stick\n"
"                    and <b>use it wherever you are</b>. Or run the calibre Content server and read\n"
"                    your books anywhere, on any device."
msgstr ""
"Bez obzira koji PC, laptop ili tablet koristite, calibre\n"
"                    vas pokriva. Ako putujete i nemate\n"
"                    svoj uređaj sa sobom – možete poneti calibre na USB fleš disku\n"
"                    i <b>koristiti ga gde god da ste</b>. Ili pokrenite calibre Content server i čitajte\n"
"                    vaše knjige bilo gde, na bilo kom uređaju."

#: base/about.html:147
msgid ""
"calibre can convert dozens of file types. No matter\n"
"                    where you got your e-book from, it’ll be ready for your\n"
"                    device in no time. When converting, you can also\n"
"                    automatically change the book’s style, create a table of\n"
"                    contents or improve punctuation and margins. calibre will\n"
"                    also detect the format that’s best suited for your device\n"
"                    on its own, so you don’t have to bother."
msgstr ""
"calibre može konvertovati desetine tipova datoteka. Bez obzira\n"
"                    odakle ste nabavili vašu e-knjigu, biće spremna za vaš\n"
"                    uređaj za tren oka. Prilikom konverzije, takođe možete\n"
"                    automatski promeniti stil knjige, kreirati sadržaj\n"
"                    ili poboljšati interpunkciju i margine. calibre će\n"
"                    takođe sam otkriti format koji je najpogodniji za vaš uređaj,\n"
"                    tako da ne morate da se mučite."

#: base/about.html:155
msgid ""
"calibre can also turn your personal documents to e-books\n"
"                    or create them from scratch. It can also take all the\n"
"                    mundane things that go with it off your plate. It has\n"
"                    automatic style helpers and scripts generating the book’s\n"
"                    structure. You focus on the content, calibre will take care\n"
"                    of the rest."
msgstr ""
"calibre takođe može pretvoriti vaše lične dokumente u e-knjige\n"
"                    ili ih kreirati od nule. Takođe može preuzeti sve\n"
"                    svakodnevne stvari koje idu uz to sa vašeg tanjira. Ima\n"
"                    automatske pomoćnike za stil i skripte koje generišu strukturu\n"
"                    knjige. Vi se fokusirate na sadržaj, calibre će se pobrinuti\n"
"                    za ostalo."

#: base/about.html:165
msgid "Comprehensive e-book viewer"
msgstr "Sveobuhvatni pregledač e-knjiga"

#: base/about.html:168
msgid ""
"calibre has a built-in e-book viewer that can\n"
"                    display <b>all the major e-book formats</b>. It has full\n"
"                    support for Table of Contents, highlighting, bookmarks,\n"
"                    CSS, read aloud, a reference mode, printing, searching,\n"
"                    copying, multi-page view, embedded fonts, and on and on…\n"
"                    "
msgstr ""
"calibre ima ugrađen pregledač e-knjiga koji može\n"
"                    prikazati <b>sve glavne formate e-knjiga</b>. Ima punu\n"
"                    podršku za sadržaj, isticanje, obeleživače,\n"
"                    CSS, čitanje naglas, referentni režim, štampanje, pretragu,\n"
"                    kopiranje, prikaz više stranica, ugrađene fontove, i tako dalje…\n"
"                    "

#: base/about.html:178
msgid "Download news/magazines from the web"
msgstr "Preuzmite vesti/časopise sa veba"

#: base/about.html:181
msgid ""
"calibre can make sure you know what’s happening and\n"
"                    <b>automatically deliver stories</b> to your device from hundreds\n"
"                    of news sources like The Economist, New York Times, New Yorker\n"
"                    Magazine, The Guardian, BBC News, National Geographic, CNN,\n"
"                    The Wall Street Journal, The Washington Post, The Atlantic,\n"
"                    Scientific American, Wired Magazine, The Telegraph, Forbes,\n"
"                    Ars Technica…"
msgstr ""
"calibre može osigurati da znate šta se dešava i\n"
"                    <b>automatski isporučiti priče</b> na vaš uređaj sa stotina\n"
"                    izvora vesti kao što su The Economist, New York Times, New Yorker\n"
"                    Magazine, The Guardian, BBC News, National Geographic, CNN,\n"
"                    The Wall Street Journal, The Washington Post, The Atlantic,\n"
"                    Scientific American, Wired Magazine, The Telegraph, Forbes,\n"
"                    Ars Technica…"

#: base/about.html:189
msgid ""
"You can also teach calibre to deliver news from\n"
"                    completely different sites or take advantage of any <b>RSS\n"
"                    feed</b>. No searching, no waiting, no hassle."
msgstr ""
"Takođe možete naučiti calibre da isporučuje vesti sa\n"
"                    potpuno različitih sajtova ili iskoristite bilo koji <b>RSS\n"
"                    izvor</b>. Bez pretraživanja, bez čekanja, bez muke."

#: base/about.html:196
msgid "Share and backup your library easily"
msgstr "Lako delite i pravite rezervne kopije vaše biblioteke"

#: base/about.html:199
msgid ""
"calibre comes with a <b>handy web server</b> to host\n"
"                    your library. In just a few moments you can <b>safely\n"
"                    share</b> all (or just some) of your e-books with anyone\n"
"                    you choose or access them yourself from anywhere, using any\n"
"                    device you like. With the server, you can read the books\n"
"                    in your calibre library on any phone/tablet using just\n"
"                    a browser. It even works offline. "
msgstr ""
"calibre dolazi sa <b>praktičnim veb serverom</b> za hostovanje\n"
"                    vaše biblioteke. Za samo nekoliko trenutaka možete <b>bezbedno\n"
"                    deliti</b> sve (ili samo neke) vaše e-knjige sa bilo kim\n"
"                    koga izaberete ili im pristupiti sami sa bilo kog mesta, koristeći bilo koji\n"
"                    uređaj koji želite. Sa serverom, možete čitati knjige\n"
"                    u vašoj calibre biblioteci na bilo kom telefonu/tabletu koristeći samo\n"
"                    pregledač. Čak radi i oflajn. "

#: base/about.html:207
msgid ""
"calibre has also some useful backup and import/export\n"
"                    features that will guarantee the safety and portability of\n"
"                    your book collection with minimal fuss."
msgstr ""
"calibre takođe ima neke korisne funkcije za rezervne kopije i uvoz/izvoz\n"
"                    koje će garantovati bezbednost i prenosivost\n"
"                    vaše kolekcije knjiga uz minimalan trud."

#: base/about.html:214
msgid "Edit the books in your collection"
msgstr "Uredite knjige u vašoj kolekciji"

#: base/about.html:217
msgid ""
"For the e-book nerds amongst you, calibre has a built-in\n"
"                    editor that allows you to <b>edit e-books</b> in the most popular\n"
"                    e-book formats, EPUB and Kindle.  The editor has\n"
"                    many sophisticated features to make editing the innards of\n"
"                    e-books as easy and efficient as possible."
msgstr ""
"Za štrebere za e-knjige među vama, calibre ima ugrađen\n"
"                    uređivač koji vam omogućava da <b>uređujete e-knjige</b> u najpopularnijim\n"
"                    formatima e-knjiga, EPUB i Kindle.  Uređivač ima\n"
"                    mnogo sofisticiranih funkcija kako bi uređivanje unutrašnjosti\n"
"                    e-knjiga bilo što lakše i efikasnije."

#: base/about.html:227
msgid "Satisfy every e-book need and get support"
msgstr "Zadovoljite svaku potrebu za e-knjigama i dobijte podršku"

#: base/about.html:230
msgid ""
"It’s unlikely, but if you find out there’s a feature you\n"
"                    need but calibre lacks it, you can use the <b>built-in plugin\n"
"                    explorer</b>. Many users develop plugins to enhance and expand\n"
"                    calibre’s features. You can browse through <b>hundreds of\n"
"                    plugins</b> directly from calibre and install them with just\n"
"                    one click."
msgstr ""
"Malo je verovatno, ali ako otkrijete da postoji funkcija koja vam je\n"
"                    potrebna, a calibre je nema, možete koristiti <b>ugrađeni istraživač\n"
"                    dodataka</b>. Mnogi korisnici razvijaju dodatke kako bi poboljšali i proširili\n"
"                    funkcije calibre-a. Možete pregledati <b>stotine\n"
"                    dodataka</b> direktno iz calibre-a i instalirati ih samo jednim\n"
"                    klikom."

#: base/about.html:237
#, python-format
msgid ""
"calibre has more than 3 million active installs and\n"
"                    <b>lots of fans</b>! You will never have to wait to solve\n"
"                    any issue you might encounter: you can use the <a\n"
"                    href=\"%(help)s\">extensive help resources</a>, or just ask\n"
"                    members of the <a href=\"%(mr)s\">calibre forum</a>."
msgstr ""
"calibre ima više od 3 miliona aktivnih instalacija i\n"
"                    <b>mnogo fanova</b>! Nikada nećete morati da čekate da rešite\n"
"                    bilo koji problem na koji možete naići: možete koristiti <a\n"
"                    href=\"%(help)s\">opsežne resurse za pomoć</a>, ili jednostavno pitati\n"
"                    članove <a href=\"%(mr)s\">calibre foruma</a>."

#: base/about.html:243
msgid ""
"calibre is created by <b>book lovers</b>, for book lovers.\n"
"                    Hundreds of motivated <b>volunteers develop</b> calibre and\n"
"                    deliver updates on a regular basis. Most issues are\n"
"                    <b>resolved in a week</b>. With every update, we fix bugs, add new\n"
"                    features and make calibre more compatible, faster and\n"
"                    easier."
msgstr ""
"calibre su kreirali <b>ljubitelji knjiga</b>, za ljubitelje knjiga.\n"
"                    Stotine motivisanih <b>volontera razvijaju</b> calibre i\n"
"                    redovno isporučuju ažuriranja. Većina problema se\n"
"                    <b>rešava za nedelju dana</b>. Sa svakim ažuriranjem, ispravljamo greške, dodajemo nove\n"
"                    funkcije i činimo calibre kompatibilnijim, bržim i\n"
"                    lakšim."

#: base/about.html:255
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Celebrate over fifteen years of excellence with us and <a "
"href=\"%(href)s\">download</a> calibre today!"
msgstr ""
"Proslavite preko petnaest godina izvrsnosti sa nama i <a "
"href=\"%(href)s\">preuzmite</a> calibre danas!"

#: base/about.html:260
#, python-format
msgid ""
"calibre started life on 31 October, 2006, soon after the release of the SONY PRS-500, the first e-ink based reader to be sold commercially in the US.\n"
"        At the time, I was a graduate student, with a lot of time on my hands. The PRS-500 did not work at all with Linux, my operating\n"
"        system of choice, so I decided to reverse engineer the USB protocol that it used, to get it working on Linux. This was accomplished\n"
"        with the help of the fine folks over at <a href=\"%(mr)s\" target=\"new\">mobileread.com</a> and calibre was born, albeit\n"
"        named <code>libprs500</code>."
msgstr ""
"calibre je započeo život 31. oktobra 2006. godine, ubrzo nakon izlaska SONY PRS-500, prvog čitača baziranog na e-mastilu koji se komercijalno prodavao u SAD.\n"
"        U to vreme, bio sam student na postdiplomskim studijama, sa puno slobodnog vremena. PRS-500 uopšte nije radio sa Linux-om, mojim operativnim\n"
"        sistemom po izboru, pa sam odlučio da obrnuto inženjerujem USB protokol koji je koristio, kako bih ga osposobio za rad na Linux-u. Ovo je postignuto\n"
"        uz pomoć sjajnih ljudi sa <a href=\"%(mr)s\" target=\"new\">mobileread.com</a> i calibre je rođen, iako\n"
"        nazvan <code>libprs500</code>."

#: base/about.html:266
msgid ""
"At the time there were no satisfactory tools to convert content into the <code>LRF</code> format, used by the SONY reader, so I decided\n"
"        to implement a converter to convert the most popular e-book formats to LRF. This converter proved to be wildly popular and far better than\n"
"        the (mostly non-existent) offerings from SONY. It was picked up and used by various publishing houses and content digitizers to produce the\n"
"        first generation of books in the LRF format."
msgstr ""
"U to vreme nije bilo zadovoljavajućih alata za konverziju sadržaja u <code>LRF</code> format, koji je koristio SONY čitač, pa sam odlučio\n"
"        da implementiram konverter za konverziju najpopularnijih formata e-knjiga u LRF. Ovaj konverter se pokazao izuzetno popularnim i daleko boljim od\n"
"        (uglavnom nepostojećih) ponuda od strane SONY-ja. Preuzele su ga i koristile razne izdavačke kuće i digitalizatori sadržaja za proizvodnju\n"
"        prve generacije knjiga u LRF formatu."

#: base/about.html:271
msgid ""
"As my e-book collection grew, I realized that managing it was quickly becoming unwieldy, so I decided to write a graphical interface to\n"
"        libprs500 to make it easier. This became calibre, in its present form, as a comprehensive e-book management tool. libprs500\n"
"        was renamed to calibre in mid-2008. The name calibre was chosen by my wife, Krittika. The libre in calibre stands for\n"
"        freedom, indicating that calibre is a free and open source product, modifiable by all. Nonetheless, calibre should be pronounced as\n"
"        cali-ber, not ca-libre."
msgstr ""
"Kako je moja kolekcija e-knjiga rasla, shvatio sam da upravljanje njome brzo postaje nezgrapno, pa sam odlučio da napišem grafički interfejs za\n"
"        libprs500 kako bih to olakšao. To je postao calibre, u svom sadašnjem obliku, kao sveobuhvatan alat za upravljanje e-knjigama. libprs500\n"
"        je preimenovan u calibre sredinom 2008. Ime calibre je izabrala moja supruga, Krittika. Libre u calibre označava\n"
"        slobodu, ukazujući na to da je calibre besplatan proizvod otvorenog koda, koji svi mogu menjati. Ipak, calibre bi trebalo izgovarati kao\n"
"        cali-ber, a ne ca-libre."

#: base/about.html:279
msgid ""
"Today calibre is a vibrant open-source community with half a dozen developers and many, many testers and bug reporters. It is used in over\n"
"        200 countries and has been translated into a dozen different languages by volunteers. calibre has become a comprehensive tool for the management of\n"
"        digital texts, allowing you to do whatever you could possibly imagine with your e-book library. Reading is very important to me and one of my\n"
"        goals has always been to prevent either the fragmentation or the monopolization of the e-book market by entities that care solely for\n"
"        short-term goals. As the calibre community continues to grow, driven by book lovers, for book lovers, hopefully it will always present an alternative\n"
"        for people that love to read e-books and want to be in control of their own digital libraries."
msgstr ""
"Danas je calibre živahna zajednica otvorenog koda sa pola tuceta programera i mnogo, mnogo testera i prijavljivača grešaka. Koristi se u preko\n"
"        200 zemalja i preveden je na desetine različitih jezika od strane volontera. calibre je postao sveobuhvatan alat za upravljanje\n"
"        digitalnim tekstovima, omogućavajući vam da radite šta god možete zamisliti sa svojom bibliotekom e-knjiga. Čitanje mi je veoma važno i jedan od mojih\n"
"        ciljeva je uvek bio da sprečim fragmentaciju ili monopolizaciju tržišta e-knjiga od strane entiteta koji brinu isključivo o\n"
"        kratkoročnim ciljevima. Kako zajednica calibre nastavlja da raste, vođena ljubiteljima knjiga, za ljubitelje knjiga, nadamo se da će uvek predstavljati alternativu\n"
"        za ljude koji vole da čitaju e-knjige i žele da imaju kontrolu nad sopstvenim digitalnim bibliotekama."

#: base/about.html:287
msgid "November 2009"
msgstr "Novembar 2009"

#: base/about.html:292
msgid "Asking for help"
msgstr "Traženje pomoći"

#: base/about.html:293
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"        The best places to ask for help with calibre are the very active\n"
"        <a target=\"forum\" href=\"%(forum)s\">calibre forum</a> at\n"
"        mobileread.com, where there are a number of friendly and knowledgeable long time users/developers of calibre.\n"
"        In addition, there is the <a href=\"%(fb)s\">calibre Facebook fan page</a> and\n"
"        <a target=\"twitter\" href=\"%(tw)s\">#calibreforum</a> on Twitter."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"        Najbolja mesta za traženje pomoći sa calibre-om su veoma aktivni\n"
"        <a target=\"forum\" href=\"%(forum)s\">calibre forum</a> na\n"
"        mobileread.com, gde postoji veliki broj prijateljskih i obrazovanih dugogodišnjih korisnika/programera calibre-a.\n"
"        Pored toga, tu je i <a href=\"%(fb)s\">calibre Facebook fan stranica</a> i\n"
"        <a target=\"twitter\" href=\"%(tw)s\">#calibreforum</a> na Twitter-u."

#: base/about.html:301
msgid "Reporting issues and asking for new features"
msgstr "Prijavljivanje problema i traženje novih funkcija"

#: base/about.html:302
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"        If you wish to report a problem with calibre or would like to request a new feature, the best place to\n"
"        do it is via the calibre <a href=\"%(href)s\">Bug tracker</a>. Be aware that calibre is developed by volunteers,\n"
"        which means that your bug report/feature request may or may not get attention, so if you are looking for help,\n"
"        the best place is the forum linked to above."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"        Ako želite da prijavite problem sa calibre-om ili želite da zatražite novu funkciju, najbolje mesto za\n"
"        to je preko calibre <a href=\"%(href)s\">Bug tracker-a</a>. Imajte na umu da calibre razvijaju volonteri,\n"
"        što znači da vaša prijava greške/zahtev za funkcijom može ili ne mora dobiti pažnju, pa ako tražite pomoć,\n"
"        najbolje mesto je forum povezan iznad."

#: base/about.html:312
msgid ""
"calibre is an open source application, developed primarily by Kovid Goyal, based in Mumbai, India.\n"
"        calibre uses a large number of other open source libraries and is developed on Linux,\n"
"        an open source platform, and as such, it has benefited from the work of large numbers of people,\n"
"        some of whom are listed below.\n"
"        I've tried to be as exhaustive as possible, but, if I have omitted your contribution, please let me know."
msgstr ""
"calibre je aplikacija otvorenog koda, koju prvenstveno razvija Kovid Goyal, sa sedištem u Mumbaju, Indija.\n"
"        calibre koristi veliki broj drugih biblioteka otvorenog koda i razvija se na Linux-u,\n"
"        platformi otvorenog koda, i kao takav, imao je koristi od rada velikog broja ljudi,\n"
"        od kojih su neki navedeni u nastavku.\n"
"        Pokušao sam da budem što iscrpniji, ali, ako sam izostavio vaš doprinos, molim vas da mi javite."

